[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:65. Jumbo Versus the Police]
[00:00.520]Passage 65 | 文章六十五
[00:02.965]Jumbo | 巨象
[00:04.370]versus the Police. | 对战警察。
[00:07.495]Last Christmas, | 去年圣诞节，
[00:10.550]the circus owner, | 马戏团老板，
[00:12.330]Jimmy Gates, | 吉米·盖茨，
[00:13.900]decided to take some presents | 决定带一些礼物
[00:16.710]to a children's hospital. | 去一家儿童医院。
[00:19.020]Dressed up as Father Christmas | 打扮成圣诞老人，
[00:21.950]and accompanied by a guard of honour | 并由一支仪仗队陪同，
[00:24.990]of six pretty girls, | 由六个漂亮女孩组成，
[00:27.040]he set off down the main street of the city, | 他沿着城市的主干道出发，
[00:30.555]riding a baby elephant | 骑着一头小象，
[00:32.765]called Jumbo. | 名叫巨象。
[00:35.245]He should have known | 他应该知道
[00:37.600]that the police | 警察
[00:38.870]would never allow this sort of thing. | 绝不会允许这种事情发生。
[00:42.010]A policeman approached Jimmy | 一名警察走近吉米
[00:45.290]and told him he ought to have gone along a side street | 并告诉他应该走一条小巷
[00:49.360]as Jumbo was holding up the traffic. | 因为巨象阻碍了交通。
[00:53.195]Though Jimmy agreed to go at once, | 尽管吉米同意立即离开，
[00:56.865]Jumbo refused to move. | 巨象却拒绝移动。
[01:00.410]Fifteen policemen | 十五名警察
[01:02.750]had to push very hard | 不得不费力地推，
[01:04.705]to get him off the main street. | 才把他弄下主干道。
[01:07.285]The police had a difficult time, | 警察们费了好大劲，
[01:10.280]but they were most amused. | 但他们都被逗乐了。
[01:13.105]"Jumbo must weigh a few tons," | “巨象一定有几吨重，”
[01:16.230]said a policeman afterwards, | 一名警察事后说道，
[01:18.140]"So it was fortunate that we didn't have to carry him." | “所以我们不必抬他真是万幸。”
[01:22.310]"Of course, we should arrest him. | “当然，我们应该逮捕他。
[01:25.795]But as he has a good record, | 但由于他表现良好，
[01:28.810]we shall let him off | 我们就放过他
[01:30.630]this time." | 这一次。”